# The terrain model is 95 MB and is only needed to BUILD horizon profiles.
# The app itself never reads it - so it stays out, and anyone cloning this
# repo can run the app without downloading it or getting an API key.
data/dem/

# Weather is a live forecast cache. Stale within hours.
data/weather/

# Everything else under data/ IS committed and is the point of the repo:
#   horizons/   500 KB of precomputed skylines - what makes the app instant
#   routes/     trail geometry from OpenStreetMap
#   walks.csv   hand-curated metadata that exists nowhere else
#   closures.csv seasonal restrictions

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# Secrets
.env
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# OS junk
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
